The Story is With Elex Michaelson via CNN on February 5, 2026:

> The U.S. Food and Drug Administration has now approved six natural colors as food dyes beetroot red was just added to the list, along with the expanded use of spirulina extract. The agency has also tweaked food labels to make spotting artificial colors easier. Health and Human Services Secretary Robert F. Kennedy Jr. Has been pushing to get rid of synthetic dyes in the U.S.